	'about_s1_b' => 'Yuka Brandt established Yuka Tiles in 2009 inside Unit 3 of Saltgate Works, an industrial brick building at 21 Weaver Street in Eastmere. The showroom was planned around an expansive south-east window wall that admits unbroken natural daylight throughout the morning and early afternoon. Rather than relying on high-intensity showroom spotlights that distort glazes and minerals, we installed a low pale-oak bench directly beneath the glass. Here, builders, architects, and homeowners compare porcelain, natural stone, terrazzo, and glazed tile in the same changing daylight they experience in their own buildings.',
