	'prices_h1' => 'Prices',
	'prices_lede' => 'We maintain transparent pricing for sample loans, architectural services, site measures, and local delivery. All listed service rates are in EUR and include VAT.',
	'prices_s1_b' => 'Our price structure covers six fixed items. A standard sample loan of up to five 30 × 30 cm samples for seven days with spec sheets is free. Large-format 60 × 120 cm boards carry a EUR 40 deposit per board, refunded upon return in usable condition. A 60-minute window appointment with a specifier at our daylight bench is free. A complete room layout drawing with joint, cut, and setting-out plans is EUR 120, credited on orders over EUR 1,500. A site measure within 25 km is EUR 85. Kerbside pallet delivery within 25 km is EUR 60. Prices in EUR including VAT. Tile and stone are priced per square metre on each range\'s spec sheet.',
	'prices_s1_h' => 'Standard services and loan schedule',
	'prices_s2_b' => 'To illustrate how our pricing applies in practice, consider a 14 square metre kitchen floor. The homeowner takes five standard porcelain samples on a free loan, books an EUR 85 site measure with Lucas Ferreira, and orders a EUR 120 layout drawing. When the tile order exceeds EUR 1,500, the EUR 120 drawing fee is credited against the balance, leaving only the site measure and EUR 60 kerbside delivery. For a staircase project requiring large materials, an architect borrows two 60 × 120 cm stone boards with an EUR 80 deposit, which is refunded in full when the boards return to our counter.',
	'prices_s2_h' => 'Worked project examples',
	'prices_s3_b' => 'Large-format board deposits are refunded immediately to your original payment method when boards are brought back to our Eastmere counter within the seven-day period or approved extension. The layout drawing credit applies automatically at invoice stage for any single tile and stone order exceeding EUR 1,500. For deliveries beyond our 25 km radius or complex multi-drop consignments, Ingrid Solberg calculates direct haulage costs before confirming your order.',
