	'privacy_s1_h' => 'What information we collect',
	'privacy_s2_b' => 'Your contact details are used solely to communicate regarding your loans, quotes, and orders, with replies provided within one working day. We never sell, rent, or distribute personal data to third parties. Information is stored securely and accessed only by our five showroom team members at Saltgate Works. You may contact hello@yuka-tiles.example at any time to inspect, modify, or request the deletion of your personal contact records from our active files.',
	'privacy_s2_h' => 'How we use and protect your details',
	'projects_h1' => 'Projects',
	'projects_lede' => 'Architects, builders, and homeowners come to our window bench to resolve delicate material junctions. Here are three rooms where selections were decided under natural Eastmere daylight.',
	'projects_s1_b' => 'Homeowner Nadia Kowalczyk visited our showroom to select flooring for a south-facing kitchen extension. After borrowing five standard cut samples on two separate seven-day loans, she brought her pale-oak cabinet front to a 13:00 window appointment. Observing two 120 × 120 cm warm-grey porcelain slabs side by side as the sun edge crossed the bench revealed subtle undertones that artificial showroom downlights had flattened. She paired the rectified porcelain slabs with Ash 07 grout sticks from our 24-colour tray, booking Lucas Ferreira for a site measure before placing the final order.',
	'projects_s1_h' => 'Kowalczyk kitchen in Eastmere',
	'projects_s2_b' => 'Architect Samuel Mensah of Linde & Mensah Studio specified honed limestone treads and landings for a three-storey Victorian terraced house refurbishment on Alder Row. Working with Amira Haddad, Samuel evaluated multiple quarried stone slabs against technical specification sheets to verify wet slip resistance ratings and confirm a V2 slight shade variation. Two 60 × 120 cm large-format boards were borrowed under our refundable EUR 40 deposit to test morning illumination on the stairwell. The resulting installation pairs continuous brushed aluminium trim with quiet, pale limestone surfaces that reflect soft northern light.',
