	'vh_t4' => '10:00, 11:30, 13:00',
	'visit_h1' => 'Visit',
	'visit_hours_h' => 'Opening hours',
	'visit_lede' => 'Our Eastmere showroom welcomes visitors Tuesday to Saturday, with late opening on Thursday evenings. Plan a self-guided review at our window wall or reserve a dedicated appointment.',
	'visit_mail_link' => 'Email the showroom',
	'visit_req_link' => 'Request a sample loan instead →',
	'visit_s1_b' => 'Yuka Tiles is open Tuesday to Saturday from 10:00 to 18:00, and Thursday evenings until 20:00. We are closed Sunday and Monday. For dedicated advice, we offer 60-minute window appointments at 10:00, 11:30, and 13:00, Tuesday through Saturday. These sessions reserve the low oak window bench and one-on-one time with a specifier. The 13:00 appointment is particularly popular because the sun edge crosses the bench, providing the clearest comparison light for tone variation. You can book an appointment by emailing hello@yuka-tiles.example or submitting our sample request form.',
	'visit_s1_h' => 'Showroom hours and window appointments',
	'visit_s2_b' => 'You will find us at Saltgate Works, Unit 3, 21 Weaver Street, Eastmere. Our showroom features step-free entrance access directly from the street for easy accessibility. Local bus routes stop within short walking distance along Weaver Street, and sheltered bicycle racks are located right beside our entrance. For those collecting large-format boards or dropping off heavy loan boxes, two designated loading bays sit directly adjacent to our entrance doors. Returns can be handed in at the front counter to Tomasz Wieczorek or Ingrid Solberg at any time during standard opening hours.',
	'visit_s2_h' => 'Getting to Saltgate Works',
	'visit_s3_b' => 'To make the most of your visit, bring scale plans, elevation drawings, mobile photos of your current space, and any physical finishes already chosen for your project. Holding your actual paint swatch, timber floor plank, or joinery door against our tiles under the south-east window reveals immediate tonal compatibility. You do not need an appointment to browse the window wall, borrow standard samples, or return loan cards, though reserving a window slot provides dedicated time with Yuka Brandt or Amira Haddad.',
